        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "A truly great team !\nFantastic crew that was Professional, Courteous, Polite and Cheerful.\nall the team had Impressive skills and ability.\nVery efficient and went above and beyond with service.\nCleanup was perfect.\nTerrific after service check to make sure all was done well.\nIf I could I would give 6 Stars!\nThank you Patrick and your team !",
        "time": 1761839040,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jennifer-Lee Gagné",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111477333206747755403/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUiUDq4odVutPhY6rDZFHavlTWlJqYTp6fC1NaDsP0oqwJzVjAM=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Fantastic service. They were very responsive, and found an availablity quickly which was reassuring, since I had a dangerous tree over the driveway. Great team with an impressive amount of machinery. They were efficient, and left the place ultra clean. No small feat after felling 6 trees. Recommend!!! 10/10",
        "time": 1758660885,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "sharon galbraith",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102475269665995548015/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUg12DVxwCbR-EwyFCP390VhrunYqiSZnGVMSQ9R4JsWiselVU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Trees and Beyond made the whole experience absolutely seamless! From start to finish, the team was professional, efficient, and so friendly. They arrived on time, took care of the tree removal quickly, and left everything spotless afterward. I couldn’t be happier—truly a five-star experience! 🌟🌟🌟🌟🌟",
        "time": 1758994342,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mado El Niño",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103049029076572936790/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUQZeJXCZ_Sf6nqJi2088Qse-zf7otiyVw4gC-V6ilI7t4n8ms=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Patrick and crew are friendly, experienced and professional. They gave us great advice about our 200 year old maple which was rotting from inside.  They came when they promised , and left the place pristine after felling the tree.  Price ended up being less than the estimate.  5 stars",
        "time": 1755566154,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Edrina Black Matheson",
